    "abstract": "Parts list for the cargo compartment lining panels, listing the impact resistant panel with its integral light against the earlier lining and its separately ordered clip-mounted light strip.",
    "sections": {
      "purpose": "This figure identifies the lining panels of the forward and aft cargo compartments together with the compartment light assemblies and the panel attachment hardware.",
      "figure_note": "Item 10 and item 10A are alternates and a compartment must be lined with one standard throughout: item 10 is the impact resistant panel with the moulded light recess and item 10A is the earlier lining used with a clip-mounted light strip. Item 20, the compartment light assembly, is an orderable item only against item 10A. On item 10 the light is inside the moulding, is supplied with the panel and has no part number of its own; an order raised against item 20 for a converted compartment returns a clip-mounted strip that will not fit anything on the aircraft, and the clips it needs were removed with the earlier lining. Sheet 1 covers the forward compartment and sheet 2 the aft compartment; the panel counts differ between the two aircraft types."
    },
